46
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:16,880
safely.

47
00:03:16,880 --> 00:03:20,800
The other thing that is commonly present in a lab is electricity, I mean any lab

48
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:24,280
you go to at least to power the basic infrastructure that is there in the lab

49
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:28,320
which could be lights, it could be fans, it could be some kind of you know

50
00:03:28,320 --> 00:03:32,120
