51
00:03:32,120 --> 00:03:34,720
equipment that you use for your experiment, you are going to need

52
00:03:34,720 --> 00:03:35,720
electricity.

53
00:03:35,720 --> 00:03:39,640
So, electricity is another thing that is commonly present in labs and it is one

54
00:03:39,640 --> 00:03:43,640
of the things that we most often take tend to take for granted because it is

55
00:03:43,640 --> 00:03:46,840
something that we see on a daily basis but still actually there are very

56
00:03:46,840 --> 00:03:49,640
great many things that we need to be aware of with respect to electricity to

57
00:03:49,640 --> 00:03:51,480
ensure that we handle it safely.

58
00:03:51,480 --> 00:03:55,720
So, then the third thing that is commonly present in labs is water, we

59
00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:59,440
always have you know some kind of sink or a wash basin where you are going

60
00:03:59,440 --> 00:04:03,840
to you know clean maybe glass utensils, maybe your hands, few different

61
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:05,160
things that you might do there.

62
00:04:05,160 --> 00:04:10,400
So, therefore, invariably labs have some source of water, some

63
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:12,200
arrangement for water in the lab.

64
00:04:12,440 --> 00:04:15,440
So, that is the third thing that is very common in the lab.

65
00:04:15,440 --> 00:04:18,520
The fourth thing that is very common in labs is gas bottles.

66
00:04:18,520 --> 00:04:20,600
Of course, it depends on what experiment you are running but many

67
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:23,840
