00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:35,920
There is gas present inside it in under high pressure.

72
00:04:35,920 --> 00:04:38,680
So, there is a certain way in which it has to be handled, so it has

73
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:39,680
to be handled safely.

74
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:42,800
So, that is the other common thing that you see in labs.

75
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:45,240
And finally, the other thing that I would highlight from at least

